From dbb9b15b9cf5a56a71b0f8f79bda2a067398730e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ss3ds <ss3ds@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:38:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: seed the Battle Frontier (overlays 80 to 83, 85,
 frontier_map, frontier_system, unk_02096910)

The whole Battle Frontier was [SS-MISSING]: its script commands (FrtCmd_*), the frontier map and system code and the facility apps are reached only through pointer tables and overlay templates, so the translator never rooted them. Seed the 28 overlay 80 files, overlays 81, 82, 83 (five files) and 85, frontier_map.s, frontier_system.s and unk_02096910.s, and drop the 245 matching Missing() stubs. port.py gains the MWCC double compare _dneq (ssd_ne, flags like _fneq), used once by overlay 80.

Static check: all 1645 added functions translate, every new external (93) has a prototype in the decomp or SDK headers, none is variadic. Not yet compiled or run on device. The Wi-Fi Plaza overlays (39, 45, 91 to 93) stay stubbed: overlay_93_arm.s is ARM mode and 45 needs more translator work.
---
 .../nitromain-perf/missing.c                  | 245 ------------------
 port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/port.py |   2 +
 .../maploader/seed-files.json                 |  41 ++-
 3 files changed, 42 insertions(+), 246 deletions(-)

